        "## Exercise 2: Daily realized covariance\n",
        "\n",
        "We extend the realized variance approach to compute daily realized covariance matrices for all 30 DJIA constituents. The realized covariance matrix is defined as:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "RC_d = \\sum_j \\mathbf{r}_{d,j} \\mathbf{r}_{d,j}^T,\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "where $\\mathbf{r}_{d,j} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{30}$ is the vector of intraday log-returns for all 30 stocks over sampling interval $j$ on day $d$.\n",
        "\n",
        "We use the same fixed 5-minute sampling grid as established in Exercise 1. This frequency is critical for covariance estimation: at very fine sampling intervals (1 minute), bid-ask bounce and price discreteness induce negative first-order autocovariance in returns, biasing correlations downward by 15–20%. This would render the covariance matrix unsuitable for portfolio optimization. At 5-minute frequency, this microstructure noise is substantially eliminated, revealing the true correlation structure.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Computing the realized covariance matrices"
      ],
      "id": "306163cd"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Use all 30 DJIA stocks\n",
        "all_stocks_raw = hf_prices.copy()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Create a synchronized fixed-grid for all stocks\n",
        "# This ensures returns are computed on the same timestamps across all 30 stocks\n",
        "\n",
        "intraday_times_5min = pd.date_range(\n",
        "    start=f\"2000-01-01 {MARKET_OPEN}\",\n",
        "    end=f\"2000-01-01 {MARKET_CLOSE}\",\n",
        "    freq=\"5min\"\n",
        ").time\n",
        "\n",
        "trading_days = np.sort(all_stocks_raw[\"trading_day\"].unique())\n",
        "\n",
        "grid_5min = pd.MultiIndex.from_product(\n",
        "    [trading_days, intraday_times_5min],\n",
        "    names=[\"trading_day\", \"time\"]\n",
        ").to_frame(index=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "grid_5min[\"ts\"] = pd.to_datetime(\n",
        "    grid_5min[\"trading_day\"].astype(str) + \" \" + grid_5min[\"time\"].astype(str)\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "if TS_TZ is not None:\n",
        "    grid_5min[\"ts\"] = grid_5min[\"ts\"].dt.tz_localize(TS_TZ)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Prepare all stocks' prices for merging\n",
        "all_for_merge = (\n",
        "    all_stocks_raw\n",
        "    .copy()\n",
        "    .assign(time=lambda x: x[\"ts\"].dt.time)\n",
        "    [[\"symbol\", \"trading_day\", \"time\", \"price\"]]\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "# Merge all stocks onto the synchronized grid\n",
        "all_minute_5min = (\n",
        "    grid_5min\n",
        "    .merge(\n",
        "        all_for_merge,\n",
        "        on=[\"trading_day\", \"time\"],\n",
        "        how=\"left\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "    .sort_values([\"symbol\", \"trading_day\", \"ts\"])\n",
        "    .copy()\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "# Forward-fill prices within each stock and trading day\n",
        "all_minute_5min[\"price\"] = (\n",
        "    all_minute_5min\n",
        "    .groupby([\"symbol\", \"trading_day\"])[\"price\"]\n",
        "    .ffill()\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "# Drop missing prices before first observed price\n",
        "all_minute_5min = (\n",
        "    all_minute_5min\n",
        "    .dropna(subset=[\"price\"])\n",
        "    .sort_values([\"trading_day\", \"symbol\", \"ts\"])\n",
        "    .reset_index(drop=True)\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "all_minute_5min[\"log_price\"] = np.log(all_minute_5min[\"price\"])"
      ],
